{"tabData": ["1-50", "51-64"], "bookInfo": {"bookId": "42000001972", "bookName": "Cuando ella recupera lo que es suyo", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000002336/42000002336.jpg@w=360&h=640", "viewCount": 3019388, "followCount": 53594, "introduction": "Cuando tenía seis años, Nuria Santos fue diagnosticada erróneamente como una niña con discapacidad intelectual y fue sustituida por Yoli Santos. Quince años después, fue encontrada por la matriarca de la familia Santos, Irene, y regresó con su verdadero estatus, dejando en ridículo a todos los que la habían subestimado.", "chapterCount": 64, "labels": ["Second Chance", "Family Bonds"], "tags": ["Second Chance", "Family Bonds"], "typeTwoIds": [335], "typeTwoNames": ["Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Venganza", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Back-to-the-Heiress-Back-to-Slay", "bookNameLower": "back-to-the-heiress-back-to-slay", "shelfTime": "2025-12-23 17:05:41", "firstShelfTime": "2025-12-23 17:05:41", "performerIdList": []}, "recommends": [{"bookId": "42000033672", "bookName": "Mi madre es piloto de carreras", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033672/42000033672.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 371, "introduction": "Racing prodigy Elena gave up her career for love and family, only to be betrayed by her husband\nand son. She came to her senses, divorced him, and with the help of devoted billionaire Sean,\nshe takes down her conniving sister and scumbag ex-husband. The former housewife then\nreclaims her championship title, becoming a brilliant star far beyond the reach of those who once lookes down on her.", "chapterCount": 67, "labels": ["Comeback Story", "Strong Female Lead"], "tags": ["Comeback Story", "Strong Female Lead"], "typeTwoIds": [341, 328, 335], "typeTwoNames": ["Regreso con Fuerza", "Fuerte Liderazgo Femenino", "Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 341, "name": "Regreso con Fuerza", "replaceName": "regreso-con-fuerza"}, {"id": 328, "name": "Fuerte Liderazgo Femenino", "replaceName": "fuerte-liderazgo-femenino"}, {"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Regreso-con-Fuerza", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Mi-madre-es-piloto-de-carreras", "bookNameLower": "mi-madre-es-piloto-de-carreras", "shelfTime": "2026-11-10 11:01:34", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-10 11:01:34", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000032861", "bookName": "El secreto de mi esposo vagabundo", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000032861/42000032861.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 1150, "introduction": "Nancy, a small-town girl, decides to marry Steven, a homeless man she rescued by chance. She does this to avoid being forced by her foster mother to marry the town bully. Nancy doesn't realize that Steven is the president of the Williams Group and is actually engaged to the heiress of the Thompson Foundation, who went missing years ago—and who is, in fact, Nancy herself. But then Lily stole her identity. How can Nancy get back what she's owed?", "chapterCount": 75, "labels": ["Love After Marriage", "Billionaire"], "tags": ["Love After Marriage", "Billionaire"], "typeTwoIds": [340, 333, 335], "typeTwoNames": ["Identidad Oculta", "Multimillonario", "Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 340, "name": "Identidad Oculta", "replaceName": "identidad-oculta"}, {"id": 333, "name": "Multimillonario", "replaceName": "multimillonario"}, {"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Identidad-Oculta", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "El-secreto-de-mi-esposo-vagabundo", "bookNameLower": "el-secreto-de-mi-esposo-vagabundo", "shelfTime": "2026-11-10 10:49:25", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-10 10:49:25", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000034897", "bookName": "Regresa para recuperar mi corona", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000034897/42000034897.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 155, "introduction": "\"En mi vida pasada confié en mi hermano y en mi prometido… hasta que su traición me destruyó.\nLa novia de mi hermano no solo iba a ser mi cuñada: también era la amante secreta de mi prometido.\nMe robaron la empresa, el futuro… la vida.\nPero he renacido con cada recuerdo intacto.\nEsta vez no seré su víctima.\nVoy a recuperar la corona que siempre fue mía.\"", "chapterCount": 62, "labels": ["Second Chance", "Comeback Story"], "tags": ["Second Chance", "Comeback Story"], "typeTwoIds": [338, 356, 335], "typeTwoNames": ["Renacimiento", "Renacimiento y Venganza", "Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 338, "name": "Renacimiento", "replaceName": "renacimiento"}, {"id": 356, "name": "Renacimiento y Venganza", "replaceName": "renacimiento-y-venganza"}, {"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Renacimiento", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Regresa-para-recuperar-mi-corona", "bookNameLower": "regresa-para-recuperar-mi-corona", "shelfTime": "2026-11-18 10:20:08", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-18 10:20:08", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000028052", "bookName": "Renací para vengarme", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000028052/42000028052.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 7641, "introduction": "Antes de reencarnar, Pablo Campos dio todo su corazón por su novia, Yolanda Guerrero. Sin embargo, en la víspera del Año Nuevo, Yolanda trajo a la familia de su amante para pasar la fiesta, e incluso se hizo pasar por la novia de él, cenando en la casa de Pablos y durmiendo en su lujosa villa. Al final, ¡le robó todo! Después de reencarnar, Pablo regresó a esa misma víspera del Año Nuevo y juró que haría que esa pareja sinvergüenza pagara.", "chapterCount": 89, "labels": ["Rebirth", "Modern"], "tags": ["Rebirth", "Modern"], "typeTwoIds": [304], "typeTwoNames": ["Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 304, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Venganza", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Renací-para-vengarme", "bookNameLower": "renací-para-vengarme", "shelfTime": "2026-09-21 00:00:00", "firstShelfTime": "2026-09-21 00:00:00", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000033755", "bookName": "Quería jugar a ser papá. ¡Ahora lo será de verdad! (Doblado) ", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033755/42000033755.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 95317, "introduction": "Elena, la esposa de Leo, rompe su copa de vino cuando Lila, la amante de su esposo, se sube al regazo y lo llama \"papi\" durante una cena familiar de los Valdés. Cuando Leo elige las lágrimas falsas de su amante por encima de su familia, Elena usa un reloj de obsidiana maldito para conceder el deseo de Lila: si quiere ser su bebé para siempre, que lo sea. Ahora Leo tiene al bebé indefenso que anhelaba, y Elena tiene el poder. Una fantasía de venganza oscura y deliciosa.", "chapterCount": 30, "labels": ["Strong Female Lead", "Revenge"], "tags": ["Strong Female Lead", "Revenge"], "typeTwoIds": [335], "typeTwoNames": ["Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Venganza", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "Quería-jugar-a-ser-papá-¡Ahora-lo-será-de-verdad-Doblado", "bookNameLower": "quería-jugar-a-ser-papá-¡ahora-lo-será-de-verdad-doblado", "shelfTime": "2026-11-13 10:00:01", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-13 10:00:01", "performerIdList": []}, {"bookId": "42000033206", "bookName": "[Doblado]Sonríe, esposo infiel: estás en cámara.", "cover": "https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000033206/42000033206.jpg@w=240&h=400", "followCount": 3957, "introduction": "Una brillante gineco-obstetra descubre la traición de su esposo en plena cirugía: su amante es la paciente. Humillada, embarazada y decidida a hacer justicia, destapa sus mentiras en un enfrentamiento viral que arrasa con reputaciones y le devuelve el control de su vida.", "chapterCount": 66, "labels": ["Family Bonds", "Strong Female Lead"], "tags": ["Family Bonds", "Strong Female Lead"], "typeTwoIds": [328, 302, 335], "typeTwoNames": ["Fuerte Liderazgo Femenino", "Relación Tóxica", "Venganza"], "typeTwoList": [{"id": 328, "name": "Fuerte Liderazgo Femenino", "replaceName": "fuerte-liderazgo-femenino"}, {"id": 302, "name": "Relación Tóxica", "replaceName": "relación-tóxica"}, {"id": 335, "name": "Venganza", "replaceName": "venganza"}], "language": "SPANISH", "typeTwoName": "Fuerte-Liderazgo-Femenino", "simpleLanguage": "es", "bookNameEn": "[Doblado]Sonríe-esposo-infiel-estás-en-cámara", "bookNameLower": "[doblado]sonríe-esposo-infiel-estás-en-cámara", "shelfTime": "2026-11-05 10:03:55", "firstShelfTime": "2026-11-05 10:03:55", "performerIdList": []}], "chapterList": [{"id": "700110442", "name": "第一集", "index": 0, "indexStr": "001", "unlock": true, "mp4": "https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/67/6x3/63x3/633x2/63320000024/700134976_1/700134976.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795186800&Signature=0sJKUCDpYefoy4XS4KXvuuIYGppTtLTo84TdmgX2qjMkiK6hASmo4Fx23I4WGi~ttT91vzUp75KObUnc9k0EPnXTFYS2OnU1Skcea6BLAJaSQYfcQQdmyQVkFUzutAksdFWxGmTtxBcFJgnlcH5v4AcFTZdEQdPYLyIiEYrGXNdBTglL6OgLblLgpO8Er7mJI6GFsk6Z8lcKHw1d31t3rvj~bfUD4lh6gxd1tWAcn25z4jIHByk8ENlddrIpX~XMv0LTUX67ykp38iC7eAcr3gheHeUpcXL4u6KrEruiOTRntld1R2aAi1LwF0lUFes~C~kKcIaMvdCHQ5w2ikTnZw__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V", "m3u8Flag": false, "cover": "https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/67/6x3/63x3/633x2/63320000024/700134976_1/700134976.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135", "utime": "2026-06-29", "chapterPrice": 0, "duration": 218099, "new": false}, {"id": "700110443", "name": "第二集", "index": 1, "indexStr": "002", "unlock": true, "mp4": "https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/77/6x3/63x3/633x